.TH LL-CLI 1 "August 2026" "Linyaps 1.14.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ll-cli \- run and manage Linyaps applications and runtimes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ll-cli
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ll-cli
is the command-line client for the Linyaps package manager.  It installs,
removes, upgrades, searches and runs applications, bases and runtimes.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B run, ps, enter, kill
Run applications and manage running instances.
.TP
.B install, uninstall, upgrade, prune
Modify the local package installation.
.TP
.B search, list, info, content, analyze
Query packages and inspect installed content.
.TP
.B repo
Display or modify repository configuration.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command help.
.TP
.B \-\-help-all
Show help for all commands.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show version information.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Request JSON output where supported.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose
Increase diagnostic verbosity.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ll-builder (1),
.BR ll-box (1)
